#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: lichtbild-gallery.php includes/class-lichtbild-block.php:542
msgid "Lichtbild Gallery"
msgstr "Lichtbild-Galerie"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: lichtbild-gallery.php
msgid "https://github.com/tstone-1/lichtbild-gallery"
msgstr "https://github.com/tstone-1/lichtbild-gallery"

#. Description of the plugin
#: lichtbild-gallery.php
msgid ""
"Responsive galleries for WordPress. Reads existing Envira Gallery data in "
"place, so galleries keep working without migration or a licence."
msgstr ""
"Responsive Galerien für WordPress. Liest vorhandene Daten von Envira Gallery "
"direkt aus, sodass Galerien ohne Migration und ohne Lizenz weiterlaufen."

#. Author of the plugin
